<div class="w3-col m3">
    <h3>Preparing your body for listening</h3>
    <p><strong>Sept. 24, 2025</strong><br />7:30-8:30 pm eastern</p>
    <p>Leo Bray</p>
</div>
<div class="w3-col m9">
<p>Listening is not something we do only with our ears, nor with only our ears and brains. We speak of various parts and
aspects of ourselves, yet each of us is one whole being unto ourselves. By intentionally situating ourselves in our
physical space, and tuning in to our individual selves and our bodies, we can more fully ready ourselves to connect with
others through holy listening, to receive what comes through them from Spirit.
</p>
